Browser, real headless Chromium, standalone generated /hive/ from source above:
  Preview built dist on local port 33247. Synthetic acceptance JSON feed, explicitly
  labelled not production telemetry; installed fresh-browser-fixture.js as init script.
  fresh-browser-results.json contains actual four poll-derived states and labels:
    fresh 0, source stale 1, backwards 2, fetch aborted 3: every engine=wasm.
    Each nonfresh state is data-fresh=false and retains the previous observation.
  One-byte corrupt wasm response gives engine=js, state=0, correct fresh label.
  Wrong wasm MIME forces instantiateStreaming failure and arrayBuffer fallback;
  fresh-browser-buffer-results.json shows engine=wasm, equality=0,
  fractional past-threshold=1, equal timestamps=0, backwards+fetch failure=2.

